<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT - Australian All Ordinaries continues to look overbought.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Australian All Ordinaries continues to look overbought.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------All Ordinaries----------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 2530 2550 2600 *RSI-14 71.39 *MA-10 2496.0</p>
<p>2455 - 2530  *Sup 2500 2480 2460 *MA-20 2464.2 *MA-40 2428.1</p>
<p>---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - May 12-------------</p>
<p>*All Ordinaries index in over-extended rally</p>
<p>*Consolidation/retracement for index expected soon</p>
<p>*Index overbought in all timeframes</p>
<p>*All Ordinaries index closed at 2,526.0 on Friday</p>
<p>The Australian All Ordinaries index has continued its bullish run, finishing last week at a record high.</p>
